  K1: PASS -- canonical: tau_min95 0.724436 Gyr, F2 OPEN; alt: tau_min95 0.831764 Gyr, F2 OPEN; 8/ln10 = 3.474356 (record 3.47)
  K1b: PASS -- canonical: recomputed tau_min95 0.724436 (stored 0.724436); chi2 tau->0 34.018 (CFG441 34.018), tau->inf 1.105 (CFG441 1.105); alt: recomputed tau_min95 0.831764 (stored 0.831764); chi2 tau->0 40.290 (CFG441 40.290), tau->inf 1.105 (CFG441 1.105)
  K2: PASS -- (a) t_need from F_need: 68 entries, max |dt| 0.00e+00 Gyr; (b) F_need recomputed with CFG920's functions: 80 entries, readings identical, max |dF| 0.00e+00; (c) reading counts = timing_summary: True
  K3: PASS -- E from CFG824 sigma_obs + LVD M_V, R_e + CFG920 Upsilon: max |dE| 0.00e+00 (40 values); k_max 8/(ln10 torb_max) 1.195670799 = stored 1.195670799
  K4: PASS -- F(t_of_F(F)) = F on 380 points, max |dF| 3.59e-14; F_bind non-decreasing in tau on 80 brackets
  all K: PASS

